              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अध्यापकः कुत्र अस्ति? adhyāpakaḥ kutra asti? “Where is the teacher?”"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Nothing in this turn is a new noun or question word. The new skill is the complete turn: asking where a familiar person is so you can speak with them."
